 "human_notes": {
  "_source": "guide (2 transcribed showcases) + jar loot tables",
  "measured_emphasis": [
   "entity:aquamirae:captain_cornelia is mentioned 9 times across both videos — more than every other mob in the mod combined. She is unambiguously the thing this mod is about",
   "The items both guides keep naming are aquamirae:frozen_key, aquamirae:frozen_chest and aquamirae:sharp_bones — a gate, a reward and a grind material",
   "aquamirae:shell_horn is named in only one video despite being the hard boss gate: a quest book should make it explicit, because guides do not"
  ],
  "boss_order": [
   "entity:aquamirae:maze_mother — mid-boss met while crossing the ice maze; announces itself with 'you feel the vibrations under the ice'",
   "entity:aquamirae:captain_cornelia — the mod's only real boss, summoned deliberately, not found wandering"
  ],
  "prep": [
   "Reach the Ship Graveyard (deep frozen ocean); everything in this mod is gated on that biome, nothing spawns outside it",
   "Underwater breathing before diving: aquamirae:salvager_suit is the mod's own answer (crafted around aquamirae:oxyhelium)",
   "Cornelia CANNOT be finished off without a debuff — the guide is explicit that she heals back up at low health. Bring a Weakness potion, or aquamirae:terrible_blade for its crit",
   "A bow is useless on Cornelia — the guide states she cannot be damaged with one"
  ],
  "order": [
   "Farm the common maze mobs first for aquamirae:ship_graveyard_echo — it is the mod's repair-and-craft currency and drops from almost everything",
   "Clear a pillager fleet ship and kill the captain for aquamirae:shell_horn (jar-verified: the shell horn is in the maze_captain loot table)",
   "Right-click aquamirae:shell_horn near water to summon Cornelia — she does not spawn on her own",
   "Cornelia drops aquamirae:frozen_key, which is the only way into the aquamirae:frozen_chest in the underground illager shelter"
  ],
  "key_drops": [
   "aquamirae:ship_graveyard_echo — called out repeatedly; crafting AND repairs most of the mod's gear",
   "aquamirae:frozen_key — hard gate, opens the final chest",
   "aquamirae:shell_horn — hard gate, the boss summon",
   "aquamirae:salvager_helmet — jar-verified Cornelia drop (the guide's mangled 'three bolt helmet')",
   "aquamirae:abyssal_amethyst — Maze Mother drop, feeds the top Abyssal armour",
   "aquamirae:poseidon_breakfast — guide calls it immensely strong: +100% ability power, -50% cooldown"
  ],
  "traps": [
   "entity:aquamirae:maze_mother breaks the ice under your feet and drops you into the water — the guide names this as the reason it is dangerous",
   "Cornelia regenerates to a floor and cannot be killed by damage alone — an unprepared player simply cannot finish the fight",
   "aquamirae:dagger_of_greed gives bad omen when used on villagers and cannot be repaired"
  ],
  "signature": [
   "entity:aquamirae:captain_cornelia",
   "aquamirae:shell_horn",
   "aquamirae:frozen_key",
   "aquamirae:ship_graveyard_echo",
   "aquamirae:terrible_blade",
   "aquamirae:poseidon_breakfast"
  ]
